{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-watermelon-slices-with-ice","title":"Dinner Lady Salts Watermelon Slices with Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eWatermelon Slices Ice\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eis a nostalgic treat designed by Dinner Lady’s team of experts to evoke fond childhood memories.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis tropical fruit nicotine salt highlights the juicy, refreshing sweetness of natural watermelon and adds a blend of other fruits to mimic the eponymous\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003ePick ‘N’ Mix \u003c\/em\u003ecandy. The mixture acquires an extra layer of depth with the koolada, which provides a sharp, ice-cold sensation that elevates\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003eWatermelon Slices Ice \u003c\/em\u003eto the next level.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuantity: 30ml salt concentrated with nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength:  \u003cem\u003e50mg and 30mg\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ci\u003e50% VG\/ 50% Pg\u003c\/i\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":41762050342967,"sku":"69d2600a0e92b","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41762050375735,"sku":"69d2600a9f35e","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/DinnerLady-Ice-WaterMelon-Slices-Ice-Salts-30mg-30ml.jpg?v=1751854490","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/dinner-lady-salts-watermelon-slices-with-ice","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




